<http://data.silknow.org/event/6e340acc-69be-3210-8719-d01da55e0586>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Tie-dyed bandhani was found with several other fragments of printed and woven silk interleaving the pages of a fifteenth century Jain manuscript of the Kalpasutra. Pieces of fine silk were often used in Jain libraries to protect the precious miniature paintings in the manuscripts."@en ;
