        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Tie-dyed bandhani was found with several other fragments of printed and woven silk interleaving the pages of a fifteenth century Jain manuscript of the Kalpasutra. Pieces of fine silk were often used in Jain libraries to protect the precious miniature paintings in the manuscripts."@en .

